# This project is developed on Windows and deployed on Raspberry Pi OS.
# Everything in the repository is committed and checked out with LF endings:
# shell scripts, sudoers fragments, systemd units and Samba configs are all
# broken or silently rejected by CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
